\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Application state:
\f1\b0  project registrations, preferences, history, and user-managed settings.\
\ls9\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Project contents:
\f1\b0  the user's actual source code, virtual environments, data, and configuration files.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Store application state in the operating system's appropriate per-user application data location. Do not store essential user data inside a directory that an installer or updater may replace.\
Updating or uninstalling the Hub must not silently delete, overwrite, migrate destructively, or modify registered projects.\
If a future version requires a configuration migration, back up the relevant state first and provide a safe recovery path.\
The Hub's own updates must not automatically update, reinstall, or alter the dependencies of registered projects.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

